# Local outputs of a run. What is published is built from them by `python site/build.py`:
# public/, index.html, receipts.html. Kept local on purpose: links that do not resolve listed by award,
# per-paper categories, and the AI reviewers' per-row answers (their aggregate results are in VALIDATION.md and
# public/summary.json).
data/output/
data/review/
validate/out/*
!validate/out/ins_benchmark_report.txt
!validate/out/ins_benchmark.json
